l":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AllH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d51b610-84ec-4d7f-8c71-e7041e93942c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"手元は全部1500だな","ts":"1637773552.191700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cdwy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6270ea0-d273-48c6-9b96-2235ef20dd01","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"先に現在の値チェックしたほうが良いかも。","ts":"1637773502.191500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0SXQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"70fe329c-5250-4cde-a8ec-f07e83226cd0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"おお、有益情報…!!","ts":"1637773493.191200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HahkM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ae05289-d752-4d9f-a9da-357738f1f6be","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL/issues/4698#issuecomment-628682785\u003e","ts":"1637773474.190900","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL/issues/4698#issuecomment-628682785|Comment on #4698 WSL2 fails to make HTTPS connection if Windows is using VPN\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL/issues/4698#issuecomment-628682785|Comment on #4698 WSL2 fails to make HTTPS connection if Windows is using VPN\u003e","text":"A simple fix for me was to set MTU to 1350 (same as VPN interface):  \n`sudo ifconfig eth0 mtu 1350`\n\nEven SSH connections are more stable now.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL|microsoft/WSL\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1589467499}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oA0Ll"}]},{"client_msg_id":"243d0d7b-d484-4471-952c-d170955a400f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ここみてたらMTU変えたら安定したってのがあるな。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL/issues/4690\u003e","ts":"1637773470.190600","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"564x172px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL/issues/4690|#4690 SSH connections hanging from WSL2\u003e","text":"_Current Version 10.0.19025.1_\n\nI have this weird issue where I can no longer use SSH connections to remote servers from WSL2. I remember that it was working ok in early builds but I am not sure at which point it started to fail.\n\nAny idea on how to resolve this would be appreciated.\n\n*What happens*\n\nWhen connected to a remote server, SSH connection hangs after a very short time. I am sometimes able to type a few letters but then it hangs and have to close WSL. It does this with every SSH connections to every server.\n\nFor instance, on the following screenshot, you can see that I was able to type a few numbers but the connection froze at the last \"1\".\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/967871/69063123-eeffe880-09e9-11ea-8c2c-d21cd908e4d3.png|image\u003e\n\nProbably related, SSH git cloning is not working either. It starts receiving objects but stops shortly after. I have to CTRL-C to stop. Here's an example hanging at 46%.\n\n`\u0026gt; GIT_SSH_COMMAND=\"ssh -vvv\" git clone --verbose git@github.com:microsoft/dotnet.git`\n\n...  \n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/967871/69064429-31c2c000-09ec-11ea-89a5-614bc02078b0.png|image\u003e\n\nIn WSL1, everything works smoothly and have no issues. It's only in WSL2 that this happens.\n\nNote that git cloning through HTTPS works fine as well.\n\nJust let me know if there is additional trace I can run to help since I know this is probably going to be hard to repro.","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/967871/69063123-eeffe880-09e9-11ea-8c2c-d21cd908e4d3.png","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"network","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"43","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/WSL|microsoft/WSL\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1574090813}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dbl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa320e81-3048-4e23-baa9-e947cd9770eb","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"です。正確にはローカルネットワークですが、マシン外です。","ts":"1637773445.190300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8YSk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0f20f51-5013-4ce0-8e01-918f08886975","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"WSL2の内側からインターネットへのsshですか?","ts":"1637773168.189600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KLJY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4d0b266-b506-43c1-9bdd-e48eca5f7376","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ファイアウォール切ってても起きたので原因は別にありそうだ :totemoturai:","ts":"1637771874.189200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LrY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b206def-9f14-491e-b1b7-5257d2b9bbec","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"別のマシンの msys 環境からの ssh は問題ないので少なくともサーバ側の問題ではないはず…","ts":"1637771522.188800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NTeY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"925018df-e12a-497b-baba-17278917c9a3","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"WSL2 環境からの ssh が最近やけに不安定…繋がらなかったり、繋がってもしばらく使ってると勝手に切れるようになった\nWindows ファイアウォールが怪しい気もしているけど確証なし…以前は問題なかったけどここ何週間かで調子が悪くなった。思い当たる原因も他には特になし…","ts":"1637771447.188000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WwjXI"}]}]
